<!--
  Simulated walk of the Red Square Walk route (MockRouteData route '1') for
  the iOS Simulator. Follows redSquareRoutePoints at walking pace (1.4 m/s),
  pausing 15 s at each stop: Red Square, Suzzallo Library, Drumheller
  Fountain, Kane Hall, then back to Red Square. About 763 m, 10 min.

  Use with `flutter run` (no Xcode needed):
    python3 ios/SimulatedLocations/simulate_walk.py ios/SimulatedLocations/red_square_walk.gpx
  Or, only while the app was launched from Xcode's Run button:
  Debug > Simulate Location > Add GPX File to Workspace... and pick this file.
  Regenerate if the route's coordinates in mock_route_data.dart change.
-->
